#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:166 settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:221
#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:259 settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:297
#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:338
